1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,600
We won't prove the conjecture now.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,750
Nor will we tell you about
Riemann's revolutionary ideas.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,900
We won't even explain Chebyshev's proof,

4
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,850
although it isn't complicated.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,600
Instead, we'll prove a theorem of Mertens

6
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:17,750
which doesn't imply the conjecture,

7
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,700
but certainly makes a convincing
case that it should be true.

